7:[["$","$Lf",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"ref":"$undefined","className":"sm:px-8 mt-16 sm:mt-32","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"ref":"$undefined","className":"relative px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-5xl","children":[["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/en/articles","className":"text-sm font-medium text-orange-500 transition hover:text-orange-600 dark:hover:text-orange-400","children":"Back to articles"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]","children":[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-orange-500","children":"AI"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Agentic Workflow: patterns, orchestration, and practical guardrails"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"A practical guide to moving from single LLM calls into agentic systems using routing, parallelization, evaluator loops, tool use, and operational guardrails."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/agentic-workflow.svg","alt":"Agentic Workflow: patterns, orchestration, and practical guardrails","className":"h-full w-full object-cover"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 space-y-12","children":[["$","section","From one model call to a workflow",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"From one model call to a workflow"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","A single chat completion call is the foundation: define messages, choose a model, and return a response. This solves many tasks quickly and should be your baseline before adding complexity.",{"children":"A single chat completion call is the foundation: define messages, choose a model, and return a response. This solves many tasks quickly and should be your baseline before adding complexity."}],["$","p","Agentic design starts when model outputs are no longer just final text, but become control signals that determine what happens next in the system.",{"children":"Agentic design starts when model outputs are no longer just final text, but become control signals that determine what happens next in the system."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","What makes a system agentic",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"What makes a system agentic"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","In practice, agentic systems combine multiple model calls, tool usage, an execution environment, some planning or coordination logic, and a degree of autonomy.",{"children":"In practice, agentic systems combine multiple model calls, tool usage, an execution environment, some planning or coordination logic, and a degree of autonomy."}],["$","p","The key distinction is control flow: the LLM can influence or direct workflow execution instead of only answering one prompt.",{"children":"The key distinction is control flow: the LLM can influence or direct workflow execution instead of only answering one prompt."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","Workflow systems vs agents",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Workflow systems vs agents"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","Workflows are predefined paths where code orchestrates model and tool steps in a fixed sequence. This gives predictability and is usually easier to test.",{"children":"Workflows are predefined paths where code orchestrates model and tool steps in a fixed sequence. This gives predictability and is usually easier to test."}],["$","p","Agents are open-ended systems where the model decides which actions to take and in what order. This gives flexibility, but increases uncertainty and cost variability.",{"children":"Agents are open-ended systems where the model decides which actions to take and in what order. This gives flexibility, but increases uncertainty and cost variability."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","Five workflow patterns that matter",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Five workflow patterns that matter"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","Prompt chaining: split one large task into fixed subtasks with clear handoffs.",{"children":"Prompt chaining: split one large task into fixed subtasks with clear handoffs."}],["$","p","Routing: classify the input and send it to a specialized handler.",{"children":"Routing: classify the input and send it to a specialized handler."}],["$","p","Parallelization: run independent subtasks concurrently (for sectioning or voting style aggregation).",{"children":"Parallelization: run independent subtasks concurrently (for sectioning or voting style aggregation)."}],["$","p","Orchestrator-workers: dynamically break down tasks and delegate work based on input shape.",{"children":"Orchestrator-workers: dynamically break down tasks and delegate work based on input shape."}],["$","p","Evaluator-optimizer: generate, evaluate, and retry in a feedback loop until quality passes threshold.",{"children":"Evaluator-optimizer: generate, evaluate, and retry in a feedback loop until quality passes threshold."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","Orchestrating multiple models in practice",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Orchestrating multiple models in practice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","A practical orchestration pattern is parallel responses from multiple models followed by a judge model that ranks outputs. This combines diversity (parallelization) with quality control (evaluation).",{"children":"A practical orchestration pattern is parallel responses from multiple models followed by a judge model that ranks outputs. This combines diversity (parallelization) with quality control (evaluation)."}],["$","p","You can also run evaluator-optimizer loops where one model writes and another validates. If validation fails, the system retries with explicit feedback.",{"children":"You can also run evaluator-optimizer loops where one model writes and another validates. If validation fails, the system retries with explicit feedback."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","Resources vs tools",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Resources vs tools"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","Resources improve model context by providing relevant data in the prompt or retrieval layer. This strengthens reasoning quality without giving action permissions.",{"children":"Resources improve model context by providing relevant data in the prompt or retrieval layer. This strengthens reasoning quality without giving action permissions."}],["$","p","Tools enable action: database queries, API calls, file operations, or external service lookups. In many systems, the model proposes tool actions and application code executes them safely.",{"children":"Tools enable action: database queries, API calls, file operations, or external service lookups. In many systems, the model proposes tool actions and application code executes them safely."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","Framework choice and production reality",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Framework choice and production reality"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","Frameworks can accelerate prototyping, but production systems often need fewer abstractions and tighter control over prompts, retries, state, and observability.",{"children":"Frameworks can accelerate prototyping, but production systems often need fewer abstractions and tighter control over prompts, retries, state, and observability."}],["$","p","When agent behavior is unpredictable, risk appears in execution path, output quality, and cost. Mitigation comes from monitoring, budgets, rate limits, and explicit guardrails.",{"children":"When agent behavior is unpredictable, risk appears in execution path, output quality, and cost. Mitigation comes from monitoring, budgets, rate limits, and explicit guardrails."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","Build principles I follow",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Build principles I follow"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[[["$","p","Keep design simple, make planning steps transparent, and document every tool interface like a production API contract.",{"children":"Keep design simple, make planning steps transparent, and document every tool interface like a production API contract."}],["$","p","Start with deterministic workflows, then introduce autonomy where it provides measurable value. Reliability should scale with capability, not trail behind it.",{"children":"Start with deterministic workflows, then introduce autonomy where it provides measurable value. Reliability should scale with capability, not trail behind it."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200/70 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-zinc-900/5 dark:border-zinc-700/60 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 dark:shadow-black/20","children":["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Published"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"April 19, 2026"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Updated"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"April 19, 2026"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Category"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"AI"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Topics"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","Agents",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Agents"}],["$","span","Workflows",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Workflows"}],["$","span","Orchestration",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Orchestration"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]]}]]}]}]}]}]]
